  "description": "What would you do for me? Despite possessing everything—money, looks, and popularity—\n\nSu-Hyun, a delinquent, yearns for love, driven by an inferiority complex. He's exposed and trampled by Na-Yeon, the model student who's the polar opposite of him. Su-Hyun vows revenge, but gradually falls for Na-Yeon's unconditional love. Na-Yeon tests Su-Hyun's heart...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
